      "created_at": "2013-08-19T22:38:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Things are really starting to come together with GSF. Looking very shiny!</p>\n<p>They could have definitely picked a better backdrop, though…  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/blush.png?v=9\" title=\":blush:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":blush:\">  (That's me in my Ra costume in the background for the first half, running a demo. I had no idea they were filming back there!)</p>",
